 ("RL", "How do termination and time-limit truncation affect targets?", "Distinguish true terminal states from artificial rollout boundaries. Explain bootstrapping and how an incorrect done mask can teach the robot that timeouts are terminal failures."),
 ("RL", "Why does offline RL suffer from optimistic action values?", "Explain distribution shift in actions and bootstrapped critic targets. Give a concrete case where the actor chooses an unsupported action because its Q estimate is wrong."),
 ("RL", "What would you inspect when training does not improve?", "Start with environment/action/reward correctness and a small overfit test. Then inspect observations, masks, targets, gradients, entropy and update-to-data ratio. Avoid proposing hyperparameter search first."),
